Yeh shehre khurasan me harsu duhayi hai,<br>
Pardes me bhai se bahen milne aayi hai.<br>
<br>
Hamsheer ko toh bhai se milne ki aas hai,<br>
Yaan bhai ne toh qabr ki basti basayi hai.<br>
<br>
Dekhi hai jabse chote bade hai siyah posh,<br>
Hathon se sarko peeti hai aur khaak udayi hai.<br>
<br>
Kehti hai yun lipat ke lahad se basad malal,<br>
Bhai chalo watan yeh behen lene aayi hai.<br>
<br>
Bolo behen se naam hai kya aur pata hai kya,<br>
Jis sar zamee'n pe aapne basti basayi hai.<br>
<br>
Mujhko pata mila tha khurasa'n me ap hai,<br>
Ya maine aake apki ye qabr payi hai.<br>
<br>
Sab log mujhko dekh ke rote hain zar zar,<br>
Is gham se meri jane hazee'n lab pe aayi hai.<br>
<br>
Aayi hoon dur se mera mujra toh lo aqi,<br>
Mitti mein kyun yeh aapne surat chupayi hai.<br>
<br>
Tha koun woh shaqi jise daawa tha haye haye,<br>
Maa baap ki kamayi mere yun lutayi hai.<br>
<br>
Joi koi pochta hai ke kyu'n haal hai tabah,<br>
Kehti hai pyare bhai se qismat churayi hai.<br>
<br>
Kya kaam mujhko shehron se basti se haye haye,<br>
Jaongi mein wahan ke jahan mera bhai hai...